# Environment files. Real secrets never go in the repo: server secrets live in the Supabase/Lovable
# project settings. ".env" itself stays tracked on purpose: Lovable writes it and it holds only the
# public Supabase URL and publishable key, which ship in every browser bundle anyway.
.env.*
!.env.example
